{"4108710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Knight and Code", "steam_appid": 4108710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    In a long-forgotten 'Code of the World,' order is collapsing. As the chosen 'Guardians,' the steadfast knight Rain and the wise mage Alia must join forces to venture into this fantasy world crafted in a soft 3D hand-painted style, repair the damaged codex, and prevent the annihilation of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    &quot;Knight and Code&quot; is a uniquely crafted action role-playing game. Here, exquisitely designed pixel heroes perfectly merge with a vibrant and imaginative Ghibli-style 3D world. Freely switch between dual protagonists, complementing a deep skill and equipment system, and create your own epic in every battle and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Unique Visual Experience:</strong> Experience an unprecedented fusion of art! Take control of a pixelated protagonist with rich details and embark on an adventure in a vivid, colorful 3D Ghibli-style world. Every pause is a wallpaper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108710/extras/cdaa81ee3555fee46247e1bb3993e38f.avif?t=1764986634\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108710/extras_big/cdaa81ee3555fee46247e1bb3993e38f.avif?t=1764986634 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Dual Protagonist System:</strong> Seamlessly switch between the indestructible knight and the magically powerful wizard. Combine their skills to execute spectacular combos and solve unique environmental puzzles. Play solo and enjoy strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108710/extras/0c0ecf9a0c9d6c714d4de23f029a142a.avif?t=1764986634\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108710/extras_big/0c0ecf9a0c9d6c714d4de23f029a142a.avif?t=1764986634 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Skill System:</strong> Your power comes from the 'Codex of the World.' Unlock and customize unique skill trees for two heroes. The knight specializes in defense and armor penetration, while the mage masters elements and arcane magic. Every upgrade brings you one step closer to saving the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108710/extras/da41763496382118beab63ce2004c1e8.avif?t=1764986634\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108710/extras_big/da41763496382118beab63ce2004c1e8.avif?t=1764986634 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Random Equipment System:</strong> Every piece of equipment dropped by monsters may come with random attributes and random skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108710/extras/e9c233f594012e41902ed7f9e6dc8390.avif?t=1764986634\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108710/extras_big/e9c233f594012e41902ed7f9e6dc8390.avif?t=1764986634 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    In a long-forgotten 'Code of the World,' order is collapsing. As the chosen 'Guardians,' the steadfast knight Rain and the wise mage Alia must join forces to venture into this fantasy world crafted in a soft 3D hand-painted style, repair the damaged codex, and prevent the annihilation of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    &quot;Knight and Code&quot; is a uniquely crafted action role-playing game. Here, exquisitely designed pixel heroes perfectly merge with a vibrant and imaginative Ghibli-style 3D world. Freely switch between dual protagonists, complementing a deep skill and equipment system, and create your own epic in every battle and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Unique Visual Experience:</strong> Experience an unprecedented fusion of art! Take control of a pixelated protagonist with rich details and embark on an adventure in a vivid, colorful 3D Ghibli-style world. Every pause is a wallpaper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108710/extras/cdaa81ee3555fee46247e1bb3993e38f.avif?t=1764986634\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108710/extras_big/cdaa81ee3555fee46247e1bb3993e38f.avif?t=1764986634 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Dual Protagonist System:</strong> Seamlessly switch between the indestructible knight and the magically powerful wizard. Combine their skills to execute spectacular combos and solve unique environmental puzzles. Play solo and enjoy strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108710/extras/0c0ecf9a0c9d6c714d4de23f029a142a.avif?t=1764986634\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108710/extras_big/0c0ecf9a0c9d6c714d4de23f029a142a.avif?t=1764986634 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Skill System:</strong> Your power comes from the 'Codex of the World.' Unlock and customize unique skill trees for two heroes. The knight specializes in defense and armor penetration, while the mage masters elements and arcane magic. Every upgrade brings you one step closer to saving the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108710/extras/da41763496382118beab63ce2004c1e8.avif?t=1764986634\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108710/extras_big/da41763496382118beab63ce2004c1e8.avif?t=1764986634 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Random Equipment System:</strong> Every piece of equipment dropped by monsters may come with random attributes and random skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108710/extras/e9c233f594012e41902ed7f9e6dc8390.avif?t=1764986634\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108710/extras_big/e9c233f594012e41902ed7f9e6dc8390.avif?t=1764986634 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Delicate pixel heroes perfectly merge with vibrant and fantastical Ghibli-style 3D worlds. Freely switch between two main characters, paired with a deep skills and equipment system, composing your own epic in every battle and exploration.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108710/4668e6c57a379048a747a0657002606377d6274a/header.jpg?t=1764986634", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108710/25c1eae0124cf329999f413b741db19983578825/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764986634", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108710/25c1eae0124cf329999f413b741db19983578825/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764986634", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"